---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <span class="text-base">
    <h1
      class="flex text-xl font-bold pb-8 justify-center xl:text-2xl xl:justify-start"
    >
      About Me
    </h1>
    <p>
      Hey there, I'm Kevin! 👋

      <br />
      <br />
      I'm a software engineer based in Vancouver, BC. I graduated from UBC in 2020
      with a degree in Computer Science and Physics.

      <br />
      <br />

      First and foremost I love problem solving and understanding how the
      universe works at a deeper level. Fortunately the ability to dive deep and
      solve problems are transferable skills into various fields.
    </p>
    <h1
      class="flex text-xl font-bold py-8 justify-center xl:text-2xl xl:justify-start"
    >
      Professional Background
    </h1>
    <p>
      In the past few years, I had the opportunity to work at companies across
      different industries and different scales.

      <br />
      <br />

      I'm currently working as a Software Engineer at <a
        class="underline"
        target="_blank"
        href="https://stripe.com/en-ca">Stripe</a
      >, helping build out the <a
        class="underline"
        target="_blank"
        href="https://stripe.com/en-ca/billing">Stripe Billing product</a
      >.

      <br />
      <br />
      Prior to Stripe, I was a Senior Software Engineer at <a
        class="underline"
        target="_blank"
        href="https://www.imperva.com/">Imperva</a
      > making security and compliance easier for users. I also spent some time in
      <a
        class="underline"
        target="_blank"
        href="https://aws.amazon.com/cognito/">Amazon Cognito</a
      >, building AuthN/AuthZ services to handle billions of requests per day
      around the globe.

    </p>
    <h1
      class="flex text-xl font-bold py-8 justify-center xl:text-2xl xl:justify-start"
    >
      In my Free Time
    </h1>
    <p>
      Outside of work I enjoy being a hobby astronomer (still lugging around my
      Vixen R130Sf telescope from 2013), hiking and exploring the beautiful
      landscape of BC, reading books with a cup of coffee, and most recently I
      have been trying to (re)learn the piano!
    </p>
    <h1
      class="flex text-xl font-bold py-8 justify-center xl:text-2xl xl:justify-start"
    >
      Contact
    </h1>
    <p>
      If you would like to get in touch with me, I'm always open to chat! You
      can find me on <a
        class="underline"
        target="_blank"
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevin-kwon-4885b013b/">LinkedIn</a
      >.
    </p>
  </span>
</Layout>
